1
00:00:04,137 --> 00:00:08,697
(Howard:)Hey, Stuart, I got you
a little souvenir from my trip to space.

2
00:00:08,908 --> 00:00:10,838
Wow, Howard, that's very nice of you.

3
00:00:11,277 --> 00:00:13,207
(Leonard:)Yeah, maybe. Open it first.

4
00:00:14,781 --> 00:00:16,941
(Howard:)It's my official NASA portrait.

5
00:00:19,219 --> 00:00:22,159
"To Stuart, your comic book store
is out of this world...

6
00:00:22,389 --> 00:00:25,049
...just like the guy in this picture was."

7
00:00:25,558 --> 00:00:28,288
(Sheldon:)For the record,
he also thinks that Walgreens...

8
00:00:28,461 --> 00:00:31,091
...and the drycleaners
are out of this world.

9
00:00:31,297 --> 00:00:37,137
That's not true. At Walgreens I was "over
the moon" for their store-brand antacids.

10
00:00:37,937 --> 00:00:40,567
(Raj:)I see you're getting ready
for your Halloween party.

11
00:00:40,774 --> 00:00:43,604
(Stuart:)Yeah, it's my annual attempt
to meet women.

12
00:00:43,810 --> 00:00:45,800
(Stuart:)Ninth time's the charm.

13
00:00:47,113 --> 00:00:51,573
Would you like me to help? I have a certain
je ne sais quoi when it comes to soirees.

14
00:00:51,918 --> 00:00:54,148
(Stuart:)Thanks, but I can't afford je ne sais quoi.

15
00:00:54,387 --> 00:00:56,287
How much forjust quoi?

16
00:00:56,589 --> 00:00:58,919
(Raj:)Don't worry about money,
I'll take care of it.

17
00:00:59,125 --> 00:01:00,595
- Really?
- Yeah, you'll love it.

18
00:01:00,794 --> 00:01:04,524
(Raj:)Ain't no party like a Koothra-party.
Ha-ha-ha.

19
00:01:04,764 --> 00:01:07,754
(Howard:)You know what wasn't a party?
That hotel in Kazakhstan...

20
00:01:07,967 --> 00:01:12,197
(Howard:)...they put you up in before the launch.
You'd think you'd get one porn channel.

21
00:01:14,140 --> 00:01:18,840
Have you noticed Howard can take any topic
and use it to remind you he went to space?

22
00:01:19,112 --> 00:01:21,312
(Sheldon:)Interesting hypothesis.

23
00:01:21,815 --> 00:01:24,715
(Sheldon:)Let's apply the scientific method.
Perform an experiment.

24
00:01:24,951 --> 00:01:26,681
(Leonard:)Okay. Hey, Howard.

25
00:01:26,920 --> 00:01:30,550
(Leonard:)- Thoughts on where we should get dinner?
- Anywhere but the space station.

26
00:01:31,991 --> 00:01:35,521
(Howard:)On a good day,
dinner was a bag full of meatloaf.

27
00:01:35,728 --> 00:01:39,528
(Howard:)But, hey, you don't go there for the food,
you go there for the view.

28
00:01:39,999 --> 00:01:41,469
That's fascinating.

29
00:01:41,701 --> 00:01:43,461
I'm gonna see if I can duplicate it.

30
00:01:43,837 --> 00:01:48,437
(Sheldon:)Howard, I've always thought the lemon
was an underrated fruit.

31
00:01:48,675 --> 00:01:49,975
(Sheldon:)Care to weigh in?

32
00:01:51,845 --> 00:01:53,335
(Howard:)Not really.

33
00:01:54,047 --> 00:01:57,177
- Oh, well.
- People say the Soyuz capsule's a lemon...

34
00:01:58,251 --> 00:02:07,021
Yeah, but, hey,
that baby got me to space and back.

